{"sha": "17cf309bb6709f13448f9761a46f8cdd6680df457172e0f7c56a1ebec047d2e5", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:complex:9}", "设 $q = \\eu^{\\iu\\theta} \\neq 1$：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n} \\eu^{\\iu k\\theta} = \\frac{\\eu^{\\iu(n+1)\\theta} - 1}{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} - 1}", "= \\frac{\\eu^{\\iu(n+1)\\theta/2}}{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta/2}}", "\\cdot\\frac{\\eu^{\\iu(n+1)\\theta/2} - \\eu^{-\\iu(n+1)\\theta/2}}{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta/2} - \\eu^{-\\iu\\theta/2}}", "= \\eu^{\\iu n\\theta/2}\\,", "\\frac{\\sin\\frac{(n+1)\\theta}{2}}{\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}},", "\\]", "利用 $\\eu^{\\iu\\alpha} - \\eu^{-\\iu\\alpha} = 2\\iu\\sin\\alpha$（", "\\emph{半角分解}），取实部：", "\\[", "S = \\frac{\\sin\\frac{(n+1)\\theta}{2}}{\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}}\\,", "\\cos\\frac{n\\theta}{2}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:complex:10}", "\\emph{1.} $\\omega$ 是 $5$ 次单位根，且异于 $1$，故", "由\\cref{thm:g12:complex:rootsofunity}，其五个根之和为零，即", "$1 + \\omega + \\omega^2 + \\omega^3 + \\omega^4 = 0$.", "", "\\emph{2.} $u + v = \\omega + \\omega^2 + \\omega^3 + \\omega^4 = -1$，由第 1 问可得。", "对于乘积，利用 $\\omega^5 = 1$：", "\\[", "uv = (\\omega + \\omega^4)(\\omega^2 + \\omega^3)", "= \\omega^3 + \\omega^4 + \\omega^6 + \\omega^7", "= \\omega^3 + \\omega^4 + \\omega + \\omega^2 = -1 .", "\\]", "于是 $u, v$ 是方程 $X^2 + X - 1 = 0$ 的根：", "$\\left\\{\\frac{-1+\\sqrt5}{2}, \\frac{-1-\\sqrt5}{2}\\right\\}$。注意到", "$u = \\omega + \\conj\\omega = 2\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{5} > 0$（因为", "$\\frac{2\\pi}{5} < \\frac{\\pi}{2}$），故 $u = \\frac{-1 + \\sqrt5}{2}$。", "", "\\emph{3.} $\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{5} = \\frac u2 = \\frac{\\sqrt5 - 1}{4}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:complex:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $(2 + \\iu)(3 - \\iu) = 6 - 2\\iu + 3\\iu + 1 =", "7 + \\iu$. \\quad $\\frac{1 + \\iu}{1 - \\iu} =", "\\frac{(1 + \\iu)^2}{2} = \\frac{2\\iu}{2} = \\iu$. \\quad", "$\\abs{3 + 4\\iu} = 5$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $1 + \\iu = \\sqrt2\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/4}$;", "$-2 = 2\\eu^{\\iu\\pi}$;", "$1 - \\iu\\sqrt3 = 2\\eu^{-\\iu\\pi/3}$.", "", "\\textbf{3.} $(1 + \\iu)^8 = \\left(\\sqrt2\\right)^8", "\\eu^{8\\iu\\pi/4} = 16\\,\\eu^{2\\iu\\pi} = 16$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} $z^2 = \\eu^{\\iu\\pi/2}$:", "$z = \\pm\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/4} = \\pm\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}(1 + \\iu)$。又", "$\\Delta = 4 - 20 = -16$: $z = 1 \\pm 2\\iu$.", "", "\\textbf{5.} $z \\mapsto \\iu z$：旋转四分之一周，", "绕原点。$\\abs{z - (1 + \\iu)} = 2$：圆心为", "$1 + \\iu$、半径为 $2$ 的圆。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\left(\\omega^k\\right)^5 = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi k} = 1$,", "且五个点 $\\eu^{2\\iu k\\pi/5}$ 互不相同，故", "这五个数恰为 $z^5 = 1$ 的全部解。它们位于单位圆上，", "彼此以 $72^\\circ$ 的等角相隔，构成一个正五边形，其一个顶点为", "$1$.", "", "\\textbf{7.} $S = 1 + \\omega + \\dots + \\omega^4$ 满足", "$(1 - \\omega)S = 1 - \\omega^5 = 0$，且 $\\omega \\neq 1$，", "故 $S = 0$。（正五边形的重心即其中心。）", "", "\\textbf{8.} $\\omega^4 = \\overline\\omega$ 与", "$\\omega^3 = \\overline{\\omega^2}$：将共轭两两配对，", "和的实部即", "$1 + 2\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{5} + 2\\cos\\frac{4\\pi}{5} = 0$.", "", "\\textbf{9.} $\\cos\\frac{4\\pi}{5} = 2c^2 - 1$，于是", "$1 + 2c + 4c^2 - 2 = 0$，即 $4c^2 + 2c - 1 = 0$：", "$c = \\frac{-1 + \\sqrt5}{4}$（取正根，因为", "$72^\\circ$ 为锐角）：", "$\\cos 72^\\circ = \\frac{\\sqrt5 - 1}{4}$.", "", "\\textbf{10.} 数值上 $c \\approx 0.30902$：与", "计算器相符。又 $\\frac{1}{2\\varphi} = \\frac{1}{1 + \\sqrt5} =", "\\frac{\\sqrt5 - 1}{4}$（分母有理化）：$c = \\frac{1}{2\\varphi}$。", "正五边形处处体现黄金比：其对角线将", "一边按比 $\\varphi$ 分割 --- 五角星的无穷", "自相似性。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 平方根可用尺规作出（即", "初中分册中几何平均的半圆作图法），", "因此仅由有理数经平方根运算构造的数", "--- 如 $\\cos 72^\\circ$ --- 是可作图的；立方根则", "不然，而 $\\cos 20^\\circ$ 需要立方根：正五边形可作，", "三等分角却做不到。高斯的判别准则决定了每一个正多边形", "是否可作图 --- 他 19 岁时作出的 17 边形", "使他选择了数学。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $-4 = 4\\eu^{\\iu\\pi}$：四次方根的", "模为 $\\sqrt2$，辐角为", "$\\frac{\\pi}{4} + k\\frac{\\pi}{2}$：这四个数为", "$\\pm 1 \\pm \\iu$。将共轭两两配对：", "$(z - 1 - \\iu)(z - 1 + \\iu) = z^2 - 2z + 2$ 与", "$(z + 1 - \\iu)(z + 1 + \\iu) = z^2 + 2z + 2$：", "即\\cref{exo:g12:complex:8}中的因式分解。", "", "\\textbf{13.} $(\\cos\\theta + \\iu\\sin\\theta)^3 = \\cos^3\\theta +", "3\\iu\\cos^2\\theta\\sin\\theta - 3\\cos\\theta\\sin^2\\theta -", "\\iu\\sin^3\\theta$；由棣莫弗公式，此式等于", "$\\cos 3\\theta + \\iu \\sin 3\\theta$。取实部：", "$\\cos 3\\theta = \\cos^3\\theta - 3\\cos\\theta(1 - \\cos^2\\theta)", "= 4\\cos^3\\theta - 3\\cos\\theta$ --- 而虚部则顺带给出", "$\\sin 3\\theta$。", ""]}